    "lint_pass": true,
    "what_en": "After activation, Claude scans web-novel text, marks AI-flavored spots, rates them light/medium/heavy, then rewrites template-y or bookish lines into natural spoken prose without changing plot, characters, or proper nouns. It can detect only or also produce a revision report.",
